    "content" : "The LVPP saddle point subproblem (3.6) can be discretized with many other techniques. We also provide results where the subproblem (3.6) is discretized with a coefficient-based Zernike sparse spectral method [39, 109, 130, 106] and a five-point stencil finite difference method. For the finite difference scheme, we change the domain to the square Ω = (−1,1)2. Here, we again use the double-exponential update rule"
