      "content" : "(3.8) for αk. We terminate once ∥uk − uk−1∥ℓ2 < 10−9 where uk is the discrete coefficient vector for u at iteration k. The results are provided in Figure 2c where we observe h- and p-independent iteration counts for the proximal finite difference and spectral methods, respectively. Further numerical experiments with the obstacle problem can be found in [85, 62, 108].",
