        "content" : "3.2. Example 2: The Signorini problem. We now consider the classical Signorini problem. This problem demonstrates for the first time an extension of LVPP to pointwise bound constraints acting solely on the boundary of a computational domain Ω ⊂ R3. In this problem, we separate the boundary ∂Ω = ΓD ∪ ΓT into disjoint measurable subsets for imposing displacement and traction boundary conditions."
